{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ae4bb77264787566c099ed2b3d4187971af1563e4709685995cd99b27e49773e","ja":"とりあえず、機材トラブルは\n●●●●プロデューサーが見てくれてるけど……。","zh":"总之，设备故障的事\n●●●●制作人正在帮忙处理，不过……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c93b5c3ad8547b0422be88b60abd9a7630720eabf10884fc76a16723afaef479","ja":"な、なんかお客さん\nたくさん集まってきちゃってますよ～！","zh":"总觉得客人\n聚集了好多呢～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"cde3eceb3b84069963d8d4c392c080f4d9747f85648f0422512496efc8e46baa","ja":"ライブの告知はもう出しちゃってるし、\n衣装着てここにいたら、こうなるよねぇ……。","zh":"演唱会的通知已经发出去了，\n穿着演出服待在这里，就会变成这样吧……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"977c40fa3a9dfd534aff4bfd6061f2b0b54eb3ebb460f60bb8e60d220e0c1d88","ja":"「機材トラブルなので少々お待ちくださーい！」って\n集まった人達に言いましょうか？","zh":"「因为设备故障，请稍等一下——！」\n要不要对聚集过来的人这么说？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"77c5b75497209d3ecb0c9fecc42f4d6821ff4bcfbaca4712a2f642dea2ea4865","ja":"ん～……でも、せっかく集まってくれたのに、\n待たせちゃうのも悪いよね……。","zh":"嗯～……但是，难得大家特意聚过来，\n让他们等太久也不太好呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4d1eaf32ea193fb7a9c15e56561dde4fd0329b74ee23776bf258e7c4ee543814","ja":"ありさなら、アイドルちゃんを見られるだけで、\n至福の時間なんですけど……。","zh":"如果是亚里沙的话，光是能看到小偶像，\n就是无比幸福的时光，不过……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"bc19da51b33527619d4d1ffc3b4cd6140e28ade6d1ee63d3d1fc8c1367cd7653","ja":"……！！　そうだ！！","zh":"……！！　没错！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"d286b925d9449b55a325a46918b973570149348dab4f168e7aee3d0799a0e54c","ja":"亜利沙さん、恵美さん！\nとりあえず何かやって、この場を盛り上げませんか！？","zh":"亚利沙、惠美！总之先做点什么，把场子炒热吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d84f2c41b53f574f2fb7180a8c521ecf5fcb9d8e6e200d671a3659e713c15ffb","ja":"盛り上げるって……。\nでも、楽器の音も出ないし、どうやれば……。","zh":"炒热气氛什么的……。\n可是，我连乐器的声音都发不出来，该怎么办才好……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3ebe04f554135dec4983ebcf2ffbc1cce928e2baddc7fec28f6d0d9492e23252","ja":"あ、ありさ、ヒューマンビートボックスします！\nまだ、全然うまくはないですケド……。","zh":"啊，亚里沙，我要表演人声打击乐！\n不过，我还完全不行呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7de70955b2f725773c641ef609fe2d23c7a6f537b910e11eb150da6e56fd21b3","ja":"じゃ、じゃあ私は……、\n楽器がなくても刻む　このリズム♪","zh":"那、那我就……、\n即使没有乐器，也要刻下这节奏♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e06081a612cc726c40af059007ed05cbdde58fbfdda21f9cc2ad3b67cafa9ecb","ja":"ラッパー可奈のお出ましだ　アーイ♪\nしびれるライムに覚悟しな♪","zh":"说唱歌手可奈登场啦　A-I♪\n为这让人酥麻的韵脚做好觉悟吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d7fcd33d9e1051c2d0ffc7b4e537c81a59f83978d6b78d85659b1f8a0cafb861","ja":"いいですよ、可奈ちゃん！　いけそうです！\n恵美ちゃんも、準備はオッケーですかっ！？","zh":"好啊，可奈！看起来能行！\n惠美，你也准备好了吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_871.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0be3ce16f405082bc25ebae388836055f8dd482164831f630fc0d1f9d293b753","ja":"あ、アタシは普通に歌えばいいのかな？\nよーし！　こうなったら、思い切りいっちゃうよ～♪","zh":"啊，我只要正常唱就行了吧？\n好！既然这样，我就全力以赴啦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
